  description: "2 Fiend monsters\nOnce per turn, during your Standby Phase, pay 500
    LP or destroy this card. Once per Chain, if you pay LP (except during the Damage
    Step): You can send 1 Fiend monster from your Deck to the GY with ATK or DEF
    equal to the amount paid. Once per Chain, if a Fiend monster(s) is sent to your
    GY (except during the Damage Step): You can roll a six-sided die, then apply
    this effect on 1 of those monsters based on the result.\n\u25CF 1: Add it to
    your hand. \u25CF 2, 3, 4, 5: Shuffle into the Deck. \u25CF 6: Special Summon
    it."
